    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Clean modern flared form with a real hollow neck and interior, confirmed in the top view. The wireframe shows exceptionally regular quad-derived topology around the flare with no pinching. Glazed ceramic reads correctly with soft specular highlights that track the orbit. Only 1.1 MB.",
